WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:02,470
I used internal points to exchange this for you.

2
00:00:02,470 --> 00:00:04,110
Just think of it as payment for your warning.

3
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:06,030
Then I won't be polite, right?

4
00:00:06,030 --> 00:00:07,910
Did your mission go well?

5
00:00:07,910 --> 00:00:09,550
I went to temporarily pick up a few scientific researchers.

6
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:10,590
But on the way back

7
00:00:10,590 --> 00:00:12,590
I saw a large number of victims heading towards Su's

8
00:00:12,590 --> 00:00:13,550
It won't take a few days

9
00:00:13,550 --> 00:00:14,670
I'm afraid there will be chaos once it's established.

10
00:00:14,670 --> 00:00:16,270
How do the officials plan to relocate these people?

11
00:00:16,270 --> 00:00:17,710
All major bases try their best to receive

12
00:00:17,710 --> 00:00:19,710
We will also arrange for some people to sponsor high-rise buildings

13
00:00:19,710 --> 00:00:21,150
New resettlement camps are being built

14
00:00:21,150 --> 00:00:22,430
We can also recruit some workers

15
00:00:22,430 --> 00:00:23,910
After the influx of refugees in the previous life

16
00:00:23,910 --> 00:00:25,150
Robbery and fights continue

17
00:00:25,270 --> 00:00:27,830
It seems like there are only a few days of peace left, right?

18
00:00:27,830 --> 00:00:29,070
The rescue team’s dormitory is no longer available.

19
00:00:29,070 --> 00:00:30,030
I want to move out

20
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:31,630
Is there no one living on the 16th floor above your house?

21
00:00:31,630 --> 00:00:33,390
The 16th floor has been vacant since it was handed over.

22
00:00:33,390 --> 00:00:35,230
I haven’t met the landlord yet, so I’ll move in.

23
00:00:35,230 --> 00:00:37,310
Do you mind multiple neighbors while I'm gone?

24
00:00:37,310 --> 00:00:38,670
Will leave supplies as rent

25
00:00:38,670 --> 00:00:40,170
Of course I don't mind

26
00:00:40,170 --> 00:00:41,730
The upstairs has long been vacated.

27
00:00:41,730 --> 00:00:43,890
Rather than letting strangers live in, it’s better to let Zhuang Yan live in

28
00:00:43,890 --> 00:00:46,620
at least safe

29
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:47,980
It's only half an hour

30
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:49,380
He moved to Xiao Shen

31
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:52,380
It seems like someone has moved in upstairs. I want to see if you want to come with me. Don't worry, Auntie.

32
00:00:52,380 --> 00:00:53,460
It should be someone I know

33
00:00:53,460 --> 00:00:54,580
I'll come out right away
